{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":19,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The burden concerning Egypt: See, Jehovah is riding upon a swift cloud, And He is coming to Egypt. And the idols of Egypt will quiver at His presence, And the heart of the Egyptians will melt within them.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"burden","s":["H4853"],"a":[0]},{"t":" concerning "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[1]},{"t":": See, "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"riding","s":["H7392"],"a":[4]},{"t":" upon a "},{"t":"swift","s":["H7031"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cloud","s":["H5645"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And He is "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[9]},{"t":". And the "},{"t":"idols","s":["H0457"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will quiver at His "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"],"a":[13]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of the Egyptians will "},{"t":"melt","s":["H4549"],"a":[16]},{"t":" within them."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Thus I will spur on Egyptian against Egyptian; And each will fight against his brother, and each against his neighbor, City against city, and kingdom against kingdom.","tok":[{"t":"Thus I will spur on "},{"t":"Egyptian","s":["H4714"],"a":[1]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Egyptian","s":["H4714"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; And each will "},{"t":"fight","s":["H3898"],"a":[3]},{"t":" against his "},{"t":"brother","s":["H0251"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and each against his neighbor, "},{"t":"City","s":["H5892"],"a":[8]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[9]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"kingdom","s":["H4467"],"a":[10]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"kingdom","s":["H4467"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The spirit of the Egyptians will fail within them, And their counsel I will swallow up; Then they will seek after idols and mediums, And after spirits of the dead and familiar spirits.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the Egyptians will "},{"t":"fail","s":["H1238"],"a":[0]},{"t":" within them, And their "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[4]},{"t":" I will swallow up; Then they will "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1875"],"a":[6]},{"t":" after "},{"t":"idols","s":["H0457"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and mediums, And after "},{"t":"spirits","s":["H0178"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the dead and familiar spirits."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And I will shut the Egyptians up under the hand of hard masters, And a mighty king will rule over them, Declares the Lord Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"And","s":["H0853"],"a":[1]},{"t":" I will shut the "},{"t":"Egyptians","s":["H4714"],"a":[2]},{"t":" up under the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of hard masters, And a mighty "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"rule","s":["H4910"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"over","s":["H5534"],"a":[0]},{"t":" them, Declares the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0113"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And the waters from the sea will be dried up, And the river will be desolate and dry.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be dried "},{"t":"up","s":["H3001"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"river","s":["H5104"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will be desolate and dry."}]},{"n":6,"text":"The river canals will stink; The streams of Egypt’s Nile will diminish and be desolate. The reeds and rushes will rot;","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"river","s":["H5104"],"a":[1]},{"t":" canals will stink; The streams of Egypt’s Nile will diminish and be desolate. The "},{"t":"reeds","s":["H7070"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and rushes will rot;"}]},{"n":7,"text":"The plants at the Nile, at the mouth of the Nile, And every place sown by the Nile Will dry up, be driven away, and be no more.","tok":[{"t":"The plants at the Nile, at the "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the Nile, And every place "},{"t":"sown","s":["H4218"],"a":[7]},{"t":" by the Nile Will dry up, be driven "},{"t":"away","s":["H5086"],"a":[10]},{"t":", and be no more."}]},{"n":8,"text":"The fishermen will mourn; And all who cast the hook into the Nile will lament; And those who spread nets upon the waters will languish.","tok":[{"t":"The fishermen will "},{"t":"mourn","s":["H0578"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; And all who "},{"t":"cast","s":["H7993"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the hook into the Nile will "},{"t":"lament","s":["H0056"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; And those who "},{"t":"spread","s":["H6566"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nets","s":["H4365"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"upon","s":["H6440"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[11]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"languish","s":["H0535"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Moreover, those who work with combed flax will be confounded, As well as those who weave linen.","tok":[{"t":"Moreover, those who "},{"t":"work","s":["H5647"],"a":[1]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"combed","s":["H8305"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"flax","s":["H6593"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"confounded","s":["H0954"],"a":[0]},{"t":", As well as those who "},{"t":"weave","s":["H0707"],"a":[4]},{"t":" linen."}]},{"n":10,"text":"And the pillars of the land will be crushed, And every wage worker will be sullen in soul."},{"n":11,"text":"Mere fools are the princes of Zoan; The counsel of the wisest of Pharaoh’s counselors has become stupidity. How can you say to Pharaoh, I am a son of the wise men, a son of ancient kings?","tok":[{"t":"Mere "},{"t":"fools","s":["H0191"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are the "},{"t":"princes","s":["H8269"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zoan","s":["H6814"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; The "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wisest","s":["H2450"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of Pharaoh’s counselors has become stupidity. How can you "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[12]},{"t":", I am a "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[14]},{"t":" men, a "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"ancient","s":["H6924"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[17]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":12,"text":"Where are they? Where are your wise men? Let them tell you and let them know What Jehovah of hosts has purposed against Egypt.","tok":[{"t":"Where","s":["H0335"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are they? "},{"t":"Where","s":["H0645"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are your "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[2]},{"t":" men? Let them "},{"t":"tell","s":["H5046"],"a":[3]},{"t":" you and let them "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[6]},{"t":" What "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[10]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"purposed","s":["H3289"],"a":[8]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"The princes of Zoan have become fools; the princes of Memphis are beguiled; They have misled Egypt, who are the cornerstone of her tribes.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"princes","s":["H8269"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zoan","s":["H6814"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have become "},{"t":"fools","s":["H2973"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; the "},{"t":"princes","s":["H8269"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of Memphis are beguiled; They have misled "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[8]},{"t":", who are the cornerstone of her "},{"t":"tribes","s":["H7626"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Jehovah has mixed within her a spirit of distortings, And they have misled Egypt in all that it does, As a drunken man staggers in his vomit.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" has mixed within her a "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of distortings, And they have misled "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in all that it does, As a "},{"t":"drunken","s":["H7910"],"a":[11]},{"t":" man "},{"t":"staggers","s":["H8582"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"vomit","s":["H6892"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"And there will be no work for Egypt, Which the head or the tail, the palm branch or the marsh reed, may do.","tok":[{"t":"And there will be no "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[3]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Which the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[6]},{"t":" or the "},{"t":"tail","s":["H2180"],"a":[7]},{"t":", the palm "},{"t":"branch","s":["H3712"],"a":[8]},{"t":" or the marsh reed, may "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"In that day the Egyptians will be like women, and they will tremble and be in dread before the waving of the hand of Jehovah of hosts, which He will be waving over them.","tok":[{"t":"In that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the Egyptians will be like "},{"t":"women","s":["H0802"],"a":[4]},{"t":", and they will tremble and be in dread before the waving of the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[11]},{"t":", which He will be waving over them."}]},{"n":17,"text":"And the land of Judah will become a source of crazed terror to Egypt — everyone to whom it is mentioned will be in dread of it because of the purpose of Jehovah of hosts, which He purposes against them.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0127"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will become a source of crazed "},{"t":"terror","s":["H2283"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[3]},{"t":" — everyone to whom it is "},{"t":"mentioned","s":["H2142"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will be in dread of it "},{"t":"because","s":["H6440"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"purpose","s":["H6098"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[14]},{"t":", which He purposes against them."}]},{"n":18,"text":"In that day five cities in the land of Egypt will be speaking the language of Canaan and swearing to Jehovah of hosts; one will be called the City of Destruction.","tok":[{"t":"